      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-28239-28661"><seg source="#source-28239-28245">お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28245-28260"><rb>姫</rb><rt>ひめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28260-28272">さまは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28272-28296"><rb>太陽</rb><rt>たいよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28296-28299">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28299-28317"><rb>輝</rb><rt>かがや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28317-28326">いた、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28326-28341"><rb>海</rb><rt>うみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28341-28344">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28344-28362"><rb>面</rb><rt>おもて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28362-28386">をながめながら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28386-28404"><rb>心</rb><rt>こころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28404-28416">をこめて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28416-28431"><rb>唄</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28431-28434">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28434-28449"><rb>歌</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28449-28491">っていられました。そのときお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28491-28506"><rb>姫</rb><rt>ひめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28506-28518">さまは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28518-28530"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28530-28533">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28533-28545"><rb>慣</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28545-28569">れた、なつかしい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28569-28590"><rb>小鳥</rb><rt>ことり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28590-28593">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28593-28608"><rb>声</rb><rt>こえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28608-28611">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28611-28626"><rb>耳</rb><rt>みみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28626-28661">にされたのであります。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-28661-29080"><seg source="#source-28661-28700">それもそのはずのこと、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28700-28715"><rb>姫</rb><rt>ひめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28715-28724">さまの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28724-28745"><rb>大事</rb><rt>だいじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28745-28763">にされていた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28763-28784"><rb>小鳥</rb><rt>ことり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28784-28799">は、かごを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28799-28811"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28811-28817">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28817-28838"><rb>自由</rb><rt>じゅう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28838-28841">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28841-28853"><rb>身</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28853-28874">になりますと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28874-28889"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28889-28892">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28892-28907"><rb>昼</rb><rt>ひる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28907-28910">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28910-28925"><rb>旅</rb><rt>たび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28925-28937">をして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28937-28958"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28958-28961">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28961-28973"><rb>産</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28973-28982">まれた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28982-29000"><rb>南</rb><rt>みなみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29000-29003">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29003-29018"><rb>方</rb><rt>ほう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29018-29021">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29021-29036"><rb>島</rb><rt>しま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29036-29039">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29039-29054"><rb>帰</rb><rt>かえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29054-29080">ってきたのです。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-29080-29610"><seg source="#source-29080-29092">そして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29092-29116"><rb>毎日</rb><rt>まいにち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29116-29131">、のどかな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29131-29146"><rb>空</rb><rt>そら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29146-29152">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29152-29164"><rb>舞</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29164-29188">いさえずりながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29188-29203"><rb>遊</rb><rt>あそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29203-29236">んでいますうちに、ある</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29236-29248"><rb>日</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29248-29260">のこと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29260-29275"><rb>下</rb><rt>した</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29275-29278">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29278-29293"><rb>方</rb><rt>ほう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29293-29296">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29296-29314"><rb>港</rb><rt>みなと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29314-29320">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29320-29341"><rb>御殿</rb><rt>ごてん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29341-29350">にいた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29350-29371"><rb>時分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29371-29377">、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29377-29392"><rb>姫</rb><rt>ひめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29392-29422">さまのよくうたわれた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29422-29437"><rb>唄</rb><rt>うた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29437-29482">と、そしてまさしく、なつかしい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29482-29497"><rb>同</rb><rt>おな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29497-29500">じ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29500-29515"><rb>声</rb><rt>こ